  "findings": {
    "mtp": "Ordinary conditional forward calls language_model.model; loader skips mtp prefix. MTP state additions depend on explicit speculative_config. The inspected HF model only references mtp in unexpected-key ignore lists. This supports a separately pinned non-speculative policy, not broad MTP/unknown-weight acceptance.",
    "generation": "Missing generation file falls back to GenerationConfig.from_model_config. Inspected Transformers5.16.1 fills unset values from text_config; Ovis text EOS is248044, tokenizer primary EOS248046. Actual installed configuration resolution remains to capture.",
    "stop": "Original SamplingParams method combines tokenizer primary248046 with derived generation stop248044 under ordinary ignore_eos=False. Native frontend currently fixes one EOS248046.",
    "processor": "vLLM checks processor_config, preprocessor_config then tokenizer_config for processor_class and delegates to AutoProcessor. Existing preprocessor declares Qwen3VLProcessor/Qwen2VLImageProcessorFast; absent processor_config alone does not prove unloadability. Runtime processor class and packed pixels remain unqualified.",
    "dependencies": "vLLM requirement is a Transformers version range with exclusions, not an exact version. Inspected5.16.1 source is a candidate to lock/qualify, not a claim about upstream installed environment."
  },
